  {
   "id": "cM5j9rg5AQAJ",
   "from": "Arthur Georges",
   "author": "a3ea45e87285d820",
   "date": "2019-07-11T00:24:12Z",
   "subject": "Re: [dartR] Re: filter.maf",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Ahh. We need to make it clearer that dartR uses a genlight object, but with some additional key features.</div><div><br></div><div>Run <br></div><div><br></div><div>gl &lt;- gl.recalc.metrics(gl, v=3) <br></div><div><br></div><div>and that should insert metrics, including maf, in the appropriate places.</div><div><br></div><div>A</div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
